menu "HubBLE Wi-Fi access point"
    config HUBBLE_AP_CHANNEL
        int "AP channel"
        default 1
        range 1 13
        help
            2.4 GHz channel of the SoftAP. The web app will make this configurable later (M5).

    config HUBBLE_ASSUME_BONDED
        bool "Pretend a BLE device is bonded (testing only)"
        default n
        help
            The AP stays on forever while no BLE peripheral is bonded (CLAUDE.md §3.5). BLE does not
            exist yet in M1, so the boot window / idle timeout logic is never exercised on hardware.
            Enable this for test builds to exercise it. Remove once pairing exists (M3/M4).
endmenu
